-msgid "It is what an upload would send, after a filter that cuts addresses down to their server, takes out what it takes for a key or a password, and leaves out the lines that are too long for it. No filter knows every key: read it before you give it to anyone.[CR][CR]To take it from here: copy it to a USB drive with the file manager (add the home folder as a source: the log is in its folder logfiles), read the share Logfiles if file sharing (Samba) is on, or use SSH."
+msgid "It is what an upload would send, after the filter of the diagnostics: the addresses of your network, serial numbers and the names of your Wi-Fi networks and of this system become markers, each address is cut down to its server, the names of films and searches and what the filter takes for a key or a password are taken out, and the lines that are too long for it are left out. No filter knows every key: read it before you give it to anyone.[CR][CR]To take it from here: copy it to a USB drive with the file manager (add the home folder as a source: the log is in its folder logfiles), read the share Logfiles if file sharing (Samba) is on, or use SSH."
